{"conversationId":11,"title":"Sordland/Turn01/Shooting","storyPack":"StoryPack_Main","turn":1,"turnLabel":"Turn 1","isDevNote":false,"rootNodeId":0,"nodes":{"0":{"id":0,"speaker":"Ovid Grecer","isPlayerChoice":false,"text":"","conditionsRaw":null,"variablesRead":[],"variablesModified":[],"outgoingIds":[{"convId":11,"nodeId":1}]},"1":{"id":1,"speaker":"Paskal Beniwoll","isPlayerChoice":false,"text":"","conditionsRaw":null,"variablesRead":[],"variablesModified":[],"outgoingIds":[{"convId":11,"nodeId":4}]},"2":{"id":2,"speaker":"Paskal Beniwoll","isPlayerChoice":false,"text":"","conditionsRaw":null,"variablesRead":[],"variablesModified":[],"outgoingIds":[{"convId":9,"nodeId":95}]},"3":{"id":3,"speaker":"Narrator","isPlayerChoice":false,"text":"Karl Greiser, head of the Sordish Police Force, was running towards us with three more police officers in decorated uniforms. They all had their guns drawn.","conditionsRaw":null,"variablesRead":[],"variablesModified":[],"outgoingIds":[{"convId":11,"nodeId":5}]},"4":{"id":4,"speaker":"Petr Vectern","isPlayerChoice":false,"text":"<shout>\"NO! GUNSHOTS!!!\"</shout>","conditionsRaw":null,"variablesRead":[],"variablesModified":[],"outgoingIds":[{"convId":11,"nodeId":7}]},"5":{"id":5,"speaker":"Narrator","isPlayerChoice":false,"text":"As soon as he made it to us and saw that we were unharmed, he let out a big sigh of relief.","conditionsRaw":null,"variablesRead":[],"variablesModified":[],"outgoingIds":[{"convId":11,"nodeId":58}]},"6":{"id":6,"speaker":"Narrator","isPlayerChoice":false,"text":"Monica was still trying to tend to Deana as Franc paced the room, mumbling that he should have stayed home.","conditionsRaw":null,"variablesRead":[],"variablesModified":[],"outgoingIds":[{"convId":11,"nodeId":72},{"convId":11,"nodeId":74},{"convId":11,"nodeId":73}]},"7":{"id":7,"speaker":"Narrator","isPlayerChoice":false,"text":"As soon as Monica heard the word, she lunged from her seat.","conditionsRaw":null,"variablesRead":[],"variablesModified":[],"outgoingIds":[{"convId":11,"nodeId":12},{"convId":11,"nodeId":16}]},"8":{"id":8,"speaker":"Karl Greiser","isPlayerChoice":false,"text":"“I am sorry, sir. I will personally conduct the investigation into our palace security force once we figure out what is going on. I can assure you I will be relentless in dealing with incompetence.”","conditionsRaw":null,"variablesRead":[],"variablesModified":[],"outgoingIds":[{"convId":11,"nodeId":32},{"convId":11,"nodeId":33}]},"9":{"id":9,"speaker":"Karl Greiser","isPlayerChoice":false,"text":"“He fired three shots at an MP -- one to the head, two to the body -- instantly killing him.”","conditionsRaw":null,"variablesRead":[],"variablesModified":[],"outgoingIds":[{"convId":11,"nodeId":11}]},"10":{"id":10,"speaker":"Petr Vectern","isPlayerChoice":false,"text":"\"What a fucking night.\"","conditionsRaw":null,"variablesRead":[],"variablesModified":[],"outgoingIds":[{"convId":11,"nodeId":52},{"convId":11,"nodeId":51},{"convId":11,"nodeId":49},{"convId":11,"nodeId":43}]},"11":{"id":11,"speaker":"Karl Greiser","isPlayerChoice":false,"text":"“Presidential guards at the palace immediately shot and killed the attacker. He has not been identified yet and will require an investigation.”","conditionsRaw":null,"variablesRead":[],"variablesModified":[],"outgoingIds":[{"convId":11,"nodeId":13}]},"12":{"id":12,"speaker":"Player","isPlayerChoice":true,"text":"“GET DOWN!\"","conditionsRaw":null,"variablesRead":[],"variablesModified":[],"outgoingIds":[{"convId":11,"nodeId":18}]},"13":{"id":13,"speaker":"Karl Greiser","isPlayerChoice":false,"text":"“The MP that was killed was identified as Bernard Circas.“","conditionsRaw":null,"variablesRead":[],"variablesModified":[],"outgoingIds":[{"convId":11,"nodeId":15}]},"14":{"id":14,"speaker":"Narrator","isPlayerChoice":false,"text":"The room went quiet. Petr seemed like he was about to say something, but with one look from me, he stopped.","conditionsRaw":null,"variablesRead":[],"variablesModified":[],"outgoingIds":[{"convId":11,"nodeId":8}]},"15":{"id":15,"speaker":"Petr Vectern","isPlayerChoice":false,"text":"\"This is huge, Anton. This will cause a lot of problems.\"","conditionsRaw":null,"variablesRead":[],"variablesModified":[],"outgoingIds":[{"convId":11,"nodeId":17}]},"16":{"id":16,"speaker":"Player_Italic","isPlayerChoice":true,"text":"Shield Monica and kids.","conditionsRaw":null,"variablesRead":[],"variablesModified":[],"outgoingIds":[{"convId":11,"nodeId":83}]},"17":{"id":17,"speaker":"Petr Vectern","isPlayerChoice":false,"text":"\"A lot of problems...\"","conditionsRaw":null,"variablesRead":[],"variablesModified":[],"outgoingIds":[{"convId":11,"nodeId":19}]},"18":{"id":18,"speaker":"Monica","isPlayerChoice":false,"text":"<shout>“ANTON, THE KIDS!”</shout>","conditionsRaw":null,"variablesRead":[],"variablesModified":[],"outgoingIds":[{"convId":11,"nodeId":22}]},"19":{"id":19,"speaker":"Narrator","isPlayerChoice":false,"text":"Petr pulled out two cigarettes and handed me one. He then turned to Evelyn. I could hear him trying to reassure her that everything was going to be all right.","conditionsRaw":null,"variablesRead":[],"variablesModified":[],"outgoingIds":[{"convId":11,"nodeId":6}]},"20":{"id":20,"speaker":"Narrator","isPlayerChoice":false,"text":"We promptly followed Karl through the winding halls and corridors of the palace. His men still had their guns drawn, which did nothing to ease the tension. On the way, Petr made an attempt to break the silence.","conditionsRaw":null,"variablesRead":[],"variablesModified":[],"outgoingIds":[{"convId":11,"nodeId":10}]},"21":{"id":21,"speaker":"Karl Greiser","isPlayerChoice":false,"text":"“This is what we know so far. We have confirmed that two people were gunned down in front of the palace. The attacker is one of them and we have reasons to believe he was working alone.”","conditionsRaw":null,"variablesRead":[],"variablesModified":[],"outgoingIds":[{"convId":11,"nodeId":9}]},"22":{"id":22,"speaker":"Narrator","isPlayerChoice":false,"text":"Monica, Deana and Franc all looked at me beseechingly. I rushed to shield them.","conditionsRaw":null,"variablesRead":[],"variablesModified":[],"outgoingIds":[{"convId":11,"nodeId":29}]},"23":{"id":23,"speaker":"Karl Greiser","isPlayerChoice":false,"text":"“As you command, sir.”","conditionsRaw":null,"variablesRead":[],"variablesModified":[],"outgoingIds":[{"convId":11,"nodeId":48}]},"24":{"id":24,"speaker":"Narrator","isPlayerChoice":false,"text":"He gestured towards a more private corner of the room and starting speaking more quietly.","conditionsRaw":null,"variablesRead":[],"variablesModified":[],"outgoingIds":[{"convId":11,"nodeId":21}]},"25":{"id":25,"speaker":"Karl Greiser","isPlayerChoice":false,"text":"“Do not worry. The situation is now under control. Please follow me.”","conditionsRaw":null,"variablesRead":[],"variablesModified":[],"outgoingIds":[{"convId":11,"nodeId":20}]},"26":{"id":26,"speaker":"Narrator","isPlayerChoice":false,"text":"Deana started crying again because of my yelling.","conditionsRaw":null,"variablesRead":[],"variablesModified":[{"var":"BaseGame.Relations_Franc_Opinion","op":"=","value":"Variable[\"BaseGame.Relations_Franc_Opinion\"] - 1"},{"var":"BaseGame.Relations_Monica_Opinion","op":"=","value":"Variable[\"BaseGame.Relations_Monica_Opinion\"] - 1"}],"outgoingIds":[{"convId":11,"nodeId":23}]},"27":{"id":27,"speaker":"Narrator","isPlayerChoice":false,"text":"Karl flipped a switch on the wall and a panel opened, revealing a hidden staircase leading to a large reinforced door. Inside, a set of emergency lights flickered on. The safe room was comfortable and spacious, with expensive-looking leather sofas.","conditionsRaw":null,"variablesRead":[],"variablesModified":[],"outgoingIds":[{"convId":11,"nodeId":55}]},"28":{"id":28,"speaker":"Karl Greiser","isPlayerChoice":false,"text":"“If I may, sir.”","conditionsRaw":null,"variablesRead":[],"variablesModified":[],"outgoingIds":[{"convId":11,"nodeId":24}]},"29":{"id":29,"speaker":"Deana","isPlayerChoice":false,"text":"“Papa! What's happening!?\"","conditionsRaw":null,"variablesRead":[],"variablesModified":[{"var":"BaseGame.Relations_Franc_Opinion","op":"=","value":"Variable[\"BaseGame.Relations_Franc_Opinion\"] + 1"},{"var":"BaseGame.Relations_Monica_Opinion","op":"=","value":"Variable[\"BaseGame.Relations_Monica_Opinion\"] + 1"}],"outgoingIds":[{"convId":11,"nodeId":31}]},"30":{"id":30,"speaker":"Karl Greiser","isPlayerChoice":false,"text":"“Paul, Jansen, follow my lead. We will bring them to the safe room.”","conditionsRaw":null,"variablesRead":[],"variablesModified":[],"outgoingIds":[{"convId":11,"nodeId":35}]},"31":{"id":31,"speaker":"Franc","isPlayerChoice":false,"text":"\"I knew it! We never should've come!\"","conditionsRaw":null,"variablesRead":[],"variablesModified":[],"outgoingIds":[{"convId":11,"nodeId":36}]},"32":{"id":32,"speaker":"Player","isPlayerChoice":true,"text":"“YOU BETTER FOR YOUR SAKE. STATUS UPDATE!\"","conditionsRaw":null,"variablesRead":[],"variablesModified":[],"outgoingIds":[{"convId":11,"nodeId":84}]},"33":{"id":33,"speaker":"Player","isPlayerChoice":true,"text":"“Good. So what is going on?\"","conditionsRaw":null,"variablesRead":[],"variablesModified":[],"outgoingIds":[{"convId":11,"nodeId":48}]},"34":{"id":34,"speaker":"Narrator","isPlayerChoice":false,"text":"He glanced towards Monica, Evelyn and the kids.","conditionsRaw":null,"variablesRead":[],"variablesModified":[],"outgoingIds":[{"convId":11,"nodeId":28}]},"35":{"id":35,"speaker":"Narrator","isPlayerChoice":false,"text":"He now turned to Monica, Evelyn and the children and spoke in a softer voice.","conditionsRaw":null,"variablesRead":[],"variablesModified":[],"outgoingIds":[{"convId":11,"nodeId":25}]},"36":{"id":36,"speaker":"Narrator","isPlayerChoice":false,"text":"Chaos broke out as some guests flung themselves under their tables and others ran towards the doors, screaming. Deana burst into tears while Franc tried to comfort her, hiding the fear in his own eyes.","conditionsRaw":null,"variablesRead":[],"variablesModified":[],"outgoingIds":[{"convId":11,"nodeId":39}]},"37":{"id":37,"speaker":"Karl Greiser","isPlayerChoice":false,"text":"“No, sir.”","conditionsRaw":null,"variablesRead":[],"variablesModified":[],"outgoingIds":[{"convId":11,"nodeId":61},{"convId":11,"nodeId":44},{"convId":11,"nodeId":46}]},"38":{"id":38,"speaker":"Karl Greiser","isPlayerChoice":false,"text":"“Good news. We are not in any danger at the moment. The situation has been dealt with and the perimeter has been secured by the guards and the police.”","conditionsRaw":null,"variablesRead":[],"variablesModified":[],"outgoingIds":[{"convId":11,"nodeId":34}]},"39":{"id":39,"speaker":"Narrator","isPlayerChoice":false,"text":"Three more gunshots rang out loudly.","conditionsRaw":null,"variablesRead":[],"variablesModified":[],"outgoingIds":[{"convId":11,"nodeId":42}]},"40":{"id":40,"speaker":"Karl Greiser","isPlayerChoice":false,"text":"“Certainly not, sir.”","conditionsRaw":null,"variablesRead":[],"variablesModified":[],"outgoingIds":[{"convId":11,"nodeId":48}]},"41":{"id":41,"speaker":"Narrator","isPlayerChoice":false,"text":"Karl turned to us with a serious face as we were about to round a corner.","conditionsRaw":null,"variablesRead":[],"variablesModified":[],"outgoingIds":[{"convId":11,"nodeId":60}]},"42":{"id":42,"speaker":"Karl Greiser","isPlayerChoice":false,"text":"“Mr. President! Are you all right?”","conditionsRaw":null,"variablesRead":[],"variablesModified":[],"outgoingIds":[{"convId":11,"nodeId":3}]},"43":{"id":43,"speaker":"Player","isPlayerChoice":true,"text":"“You can say that again.\"","conditionsRaw":null,"variablesRead":[],"variablesModified":[],"outgoingIds":[{"convId":11,"nodeId":41}]},"44":{"id":44,"speaker":"Player","isPlayerChoice":true,"text":"“THEN TELL ME HOW THIS CIRCUS SHOW HAPPENED IN MY BALL.\"","conditionsRaw":null,"variablesRead":[],"variablesModified":[],"outgoingIds":[{"convId":11,"nodeId":14}]},"45":{"id":45,"speaker":"Karl Greiser","isPlayerChoice":false,"text":"“One second, Mr. President.”","conditionsRaw":null,"variablesRead":[],"variablesModified":[],"outgoingIds":[{"convId":11,"nodeId":59}]},"46":{"id":46,"speaker":"Player","isPlayerChoice":true,"text":"“Sorry for yelling, Karl. I'm just a bit nervous right now.\"","conditionsRaw":null,"variablesRead":[],"variablesModified":[],"outgoingIds":[{"convId":11,"nodeId":47}]},"47":{"id":47,"speaker":"Karl Greiser","isPlayerChoice":false,"text":"I completely understand, sir. I will personally conduct the investigation into our palace security force and I can assure you I will be relentless in dealing with incompetence.”","conditionsRaw":null,"variablesRead":[],"variablesModified":[],"outgoingIds":[{"convId":11,"nodeId":33}]},"48":{"id":48,"speaker":"Narrator","isPlayerChoice":false,"text":"Karl's radio suddenly crackled to life. Every second felt like an eternity as he pressed his ear to the receiver. When it fell silent, he turned to us.","conditionsRaw":null,"variablesRead":[],"variablesModified":[],"outgoingIds":[{"convId":11,"nodeId":38}]},"49":{"id":49,"speaker":"Player","isPlayerChoice":true,"text":"“Can't you shut your mouth for a bit?\"","conditionsRaw":null,"variablesRead":[],"variablesModified":[],"outgoingIds":[{"convId":11,"nodeId":41}]},"50":{"id":50,"speaker":"Karl Greiser","isPlayerChoice":false,"text":"“I should receive confirmation soon, Mr. President. Everything is under control.”","conditionsRaw":null,"variablesRead":[],"variablesModified":[],"outgoingIds":[{"convId":11,"nodeId":48}]},"51":{"id":51,"speaker":"Player","isPlayerChoice":true,"text":"“Sssshh. Not now Petr.\"","conditionsRaw":null,"variablesRead":[],"variablesModified":[],"outgoingIds":[{"convId":11,"nodeId":41}]},"52":{"id":52,"speaker":"Player","isPlayerChoice":true,"text":"“It's not over yet.\"","conditionsRaw":null,"variablesRead":[],"variablesModified":[],"outgoingIds":[{"convId":11,"nodeId":41}]},"53":{"id":53,"speaker":"Narrator","isPlayerChoice":false,"text":"Petr let out a nervous laugh.","conditionsRaw":null,"variablesRead":[],"variablesModified":[],"outgoingIds":[{"convId":11,"nodeId":40}]},"54":{"id":54,"speaker":"Player","isPlayerChoice":true,"text":"“So, what's the status?\"","conditionsRaw":null,"variablesRead":[],"variablesModified":[],"outgoingIds":[{"convId":11,"nodeId":48}]},"55":{"id":55,"speaker":"Narrator","isPlayerChoice":false,"text":"Small security monitors on the wall displayed grainy footage of each room in the palace. There was a boardroom and a pantry containing enough provisions to last us months. Monica and Evelyn sat the children down and started wiping their tears.","conditionsRaw":null,"variablesRead":[],"variablesModified":[],"outgoingIds":[{"convId":11,"nodeId":63}]},"56":{"id":56,"speaker":"Karl Greiser","isPlayerChoice":false,"text":"“I should receive confirmation soon, Mr. President. Everything is under control.”","conditionsRaw":null,"variablesRead":[],"variablesModified":[],"outgoingIds":[{"convId":11,"nodeId":48}]},"57":{"id":57,"speaker":"Player","isPlayerChoice":true,"text":"“Check the perimeter.\"","conditionsRaw":null,"variablesRead":[],"variablesModified":[],"outgoingIds":[{"convId":11,"nodeId":59}]},"58":{"id":58,"speaker":"Karl Greiser","isPlayerChoice":false,"text":"“Thank God.”","conditionsRaw":null,"variablesRead":[],"variablesModified":[],"outgoingIds":[{"convId":11,"nodeId":66},{"convId":11,"nodeId":64},{"convId":11,"nodeId":57}]},"59":{"id":59,"speaker":"Narrator","isPlayerChoice":false,"text":"He turned around quickly to his men.","conditionsRaw":null,"variablesRead":[],"variablesModified":[],"outgoingIds":[{"convId":11,"nodeId":62}]},"60":{"id":60,"speaker":"Karl Greiser","isPlayerChoice":false,"text":"“Quiet, please.”","conditionsRaw":null,"variablesRead":[],"variablesModified":[],"outgoingIds":[{"convId":11,"nodeId":71}]},"61":{"id":61,"speaker":"Player","isPlayerChoice":true,"text":"“Are we under attack? Who is attacking us? What is going on?!\"","conditionsRaw":null,"variablesRead":[],"variablesModified":[],"outgoingIds":[{"convId":11,"nodeId":50}]},"62":{"id":62,"speaker":"Karl Greiser","isPlayerChoice":false,"text":"“CHECK THE PERIMETER! NOW!”","conditionsRaw":null,"variablesRead":[],"variablesModified":[],"outgoingIds":[{"convId":11,"nodeId":30}]},"63":{"id":63,"speaker":"Narrator","isPlayerChoice":false,"text":"Karl stepped away from us and made a few radio calls. When he was done, he returned to me and Petr.","conditionsRaw":null,"variablesRead":[],"variablesModified":[],"outgoingIds":[{"convId":11,"nodeId":54},{"convId":11,"nodeId":65},{"convId":11,"nodeId":67},{"convId":11,"nodeId":69}]},"64":{"id":64,"speaker":"Player","isPlayerChoice":true,"text":"“STATUS REPORT!\"","conditionsRaw":null,"variablesRead":[],"variablesModified":[],"outgoingIds":[{"convId":11,"nodeId":45}]},"65":{"id":65,"speaker":"Player","isPlayerChoice":true,"text":"“Not the best inauguration ball I've been to.\"","conditionsRaw":null,"variablesRead":[],"variablesModified":[],"outgoingIds":[{"convId":11,"nodeId":53}]},"66":{"id":66,"speaker":"Player","isPlayerChoice":true,"text":"“What the hell is going on?!\"","conditionsRaw":null,"variablesRead":[],"variablesModified":[],"outgoingIds":[{"convId":11,"nodeId":45}]},"67":{"id":67,"speaker":"Player","isPlayerChoice":true,"text":"“Are we under attack? Who is attacking us? What is going on?!\"","conditionsRaw":null,"variablesRead":[],"variablesModified":[],"outgoingIds":[{"convId":11,"nodeId":56}]},"68":{"id":68,"speaker":"Evelyn Vectern","isPlayerChoice":false,"text":"“Petr, shut up.\"","conditionsRaw":null,"variablesRead":[],"variablesModified":[],"outgoingIds":[{"convId":11,"nodeId":27}]},"69":{"id":69,"speaker":"Player","isPlayerChoice":true,"text":"“So tell me Karl. DO I HAVE CLOWNS FOR A SECURITY FORCE?\"","conditionsRaw":null,"variablesRead":[],"variablesModified":[],"outgoingIds":[{"convId":11,"nodeId":70}]},"70":{"id":70,"speaker":"Narrator","isPlayerChoice":false,"text":"As I raised my voice, he lowered his head in respect.","conditionsRaw":null,"variablesRead":[],"variablesModified":[],"outgoingIds":[{"convId":11,"nodeId":37}]},"71":{"id":71,"speaker":"Petr Vectern","isPlayerChoice":false,"text":"\"Sorry, I talk when I get nervous.\"","conditionsRaw":null,"variablesRead":[],"variablesModified":[],"outgoingIds":[{"convId":11,"nodeId":68}]},"72":{"id":72,"speaker":"Player_Italic","isPlayerChoice":true,"text":"Comfort Monica and the kids.","conditionsRaw":null,"variablesRead":[],"variablesModified":[],"outgoingIds":[{"convId":11,"nodeId":75},{"convId":11,"nodeId":82}]},"73":{"id":73,"speaker":"Player_Italic","isPlayerChoice":true,"text":"Smoke alone.","conditionsRaw":null,"variablesRead":[],"variablesModified":[],"outgoingIds":[{"convId":11,"nodeId":76}]},"74":{"id":74,"speaker":"Player","isPlayerChoice":true,"text":"\"Petr, old friend, what the hell have we gotten ourselves into?\"","conditionsRaw":null,"variablesRead":[],"variablesModified":[],"outgoingIds":[{"convId":11,"nodeId":80}]},"75":{"id":75,"speaker":"Player","isPlayerChoice":true,"text":"\"Nothing like this will ever happen again. I'll make sure of it.\"","conditionsRaw":null,"variablesRead":[],"variablesModified":[],"outgoingIds":[{"convId":11,"nodeId":77}]},"76":{"id":76,"speaker":"Narrator","isPlayerChoice":false,"text":"As I continued smoking, a peculiar calm washed over me.","conditionsRaw":null,"variablesRead":[],"variablesModified":[],"outgoingIds":[{"convId":11,"nodeId":79}]},"77":{"id":77,"speaker":"Monica","isPlayerChoice":true,"text":"\"We can't be sure of anything anymore, Anton.\"","conditionsRaw":null,"variablesRead":[],"variablesModified":[],"outgoingIds":[{"convId":11,"nodeId":85}]},"78":{"id":78,"speaker":"Narrator","isPlayerChoice":false,"text":"I lit my cigarette and took a deep drag. I was going to see this through and keep my family safe.","conditionsRaw":null,"variablesRead":[],"variablesModified":[{"var":"BaseGame.Relations_Franc_Opinion","op":"=","value":"Variable[\"BaseGame.Relations_Franc_Opinion\"] + 1"},{"var":"BaseGame.Relations_Monica_Opinion","op":"=","value":"Variable[\"BaseGame.Relations_Monica_Opinion\"] + 1"}],"outgoingIds":[{"convId":11,"nodeId":2}]},"79":{"id":79,"speaker":"Narrator","isPlayerChoice":false,"text":"I was going to see this through.","conditionsRaw":null,"variablesRead":[],"variablesModified":[],"outgoingIds":[{"convId":11,"nodeId":86}]},"80":{"id":80,"speaker":"Petr Vectern","isPlayerChoice":false,"text":"\"Nothing you and I can't handle, Anton.\"","conditionsRaw":null,"variablesRead":[],"variablesModified":[],"outgoingIds":[{"convId":11,"nodeId":81}]},"81":{"id":81,"speaker":"Narrator","isPlayerChoice":false,"text":"I lit my cigarette and took a deep drag. We were going to see this through.","conditionsRaw":null,"variablesRead":[],"variablesModified":[],"outgoingIds":[{"convId":11,"nodeId":2}]},"82":{"id":82,"speaker":"Player","isPlayerChoice":true,"text":"\"We are safe. I'll make sure everything's going to be fine.\"","conditionsRaw":null,"variablesRead":[],"variablesModified":[],"outgoingIds":[{"convId":11,"nodeId":77}]},"83":{"id":83,"speaker":"Paskal Beniwoll","isPlayerChoice":false,"text":"","conditionsRaw":null,"variablesRead":[],"variablesModified":[{"var":"BaseGame.Relations_Franc_Opinion","op":"=","value":"Variable[\"BaseGame.Relations_Franc_Opinion\"] + 1"},{"var":"BaseGame.Relations_Monica_Opinion","op":"=","value":"Variable[\"BaseGame.Relations_Monica_Opinion\"] + 1"}],"outgoingIds":[{"convId":11,"nodeId":29}]},"84":{"id":84,"speaker":"Paskal Beniwoll","isPlayerChoice":false,"text":"","conditionsRaw":null,"variablesRead":[],"variablesModified":[{"var":"BaseGame.Relations_Franc_Opinion","op":"=","value":"Variable[\"BaseGame.Relations_Franc_Opinion\"] - 1"},{"var":"BaseGame.Relations_Monica_Opinion","op":"=","value":"Variable[\"BaseGame.Relations_Monica_Opinion\"] - 1"}],"outgoingIds":[{"convId":11,"nodeId":26}]},"85":{"id":85,"speaker":"Paskal Beniwoll","isPlayerChoice":false,"text":"","conditionsRaw":null,"variablesRead":[],"variablesModified":[{"var":"BaseGame.Relations_Franc_Opinion","op":"=","value":"Variable[\"BaseGame.Relations_Franc_Opinion\"] + 1"},{"var":"BaseGame.Relations_Monica_Opinion","op":"=","value":"Variable[\"BaseGame.Relations_Monica_Opinion\"] + 1"}],"outgoingIds":[{"convId":11,"nodeId":78}]},"86":{"id":86,"speaker":"Paskal Beniwoll","isPlayerChoice":false,"text":"","conditionsRaw":null,"variablesRead":[],"variablesModified":[{"var":"BaseGame.Relations_Franc_Opinion","op":"=","value":"Variable[\"BaseGame.Relations_Franc_Opinion\"] - 1"},{"var":"BaseGame.Relations_Monica_Opinion","op":"=","value":"Variable[\"BaseGame.Relations_Monica_Opinion\"] - 1"}],"outgoingIds":[{"convId":11,"nodeId":2}]}}}